{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-1","title":"1 Chronicles 16:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David's festival sacrifice. 4 He orders a choir to sing thanksgiving. 7 The psalm of thanksgiving. 37 He appoints ministers, porters, priests, and musicians, to attend continually on the ark.</p>\n<p>they brought. 2Sa 6:17-19; 1Ki 8:6; 2Ch 5:7 in the midst. 15:1,12; 2Ch 1:4; Ps 132:8 they offered. 1Ki 8:5; 2Ch 5:6; Ezr 6:16-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-2","title":"1 Chronicles 16:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>the burnt. Le 1:3 he blessed. Ge 14:19; 20:7; 47:7,10; Nu 6:23-27; Jos 22:6; 2Sa 6:18 1Ki 8:55,56; 2Ch 29:29; 30:18-20,27; Lu 24:50,51; Heb 7:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-3","title":"1 Chronicles 16:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>to every one. 2Ch 30:24; 35:7,8; Ne 8:10; Eze 45:17; 1Pe 4:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-4","title":"1 Chronicles 16:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>he appointed. 15:16; 23:2-6; 24:3 minister. 37-42; 23:27-32; Nu 18:1-6 to record. 8; Ps 37:1; 70:1; *titles Ps 103:2; 105:5; Isa 62:6,7 the Lord God. Ge 17:7; 32:28; 33:20; *marg: 1Ki 8:15; Ps 72:18; 106:48</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-5","title":"1 Chronicles 16:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Asaph. 6:39; 15:16-24; 25:1-6 psalteries and with harps. Heb. instruments of psalteriesand harps. 15:20,21; 2Ch 29:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-6","title":"1 Chronicles 16:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>with trumpets. Nu 10:8; 2Ch 5:12,13; 13:12; 29:26-28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-7","title":"1 Chronicles 16:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>on that day. 2Sa 22:1; 23:1,2; 2Ch 29:30; Ne 12:24 into the hand. Ps 12:1; 18:1; *titles</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-8","title":"1 Chronicles 16:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Give thanks.This beautiful hymn, to the 22nd verse, is nearly the same as Ps 105:1-15; from the 23rd to the 33rd it accords with Ps 96; and the conclusion agrees with Ps 106, with the addition of ver. 34-36.</p>\n<p>Ps 105:1-15 call. Isa 12:4; Ac 9:14; 1Co 1:2 make. 1Ki 8:43; 2Ki 19:19; Ps 67:2-4; 78:3-6; 145:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-9","title":"1 Chronicles 16:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Sing unto. Ps 95:1,2; 96:1,2; 98:1-4; Mal 3:16 psalms. Mt 26:30; Eph 5:19; Col 3:16; Jas 5:13 talk ye. Ps 40:10; 71:17; 96:3; 145:4-6,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-10","title":"1 Chronicles 16:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Glory. Ps 34:2; Isa 45:25; Jer 9:23,24; 1Co 1:30,31; *Gr: let the heart. 28:9; Pr 8:17; Isa 45:19; 55:6,7; Jer 29:13; Mt 7:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-11","title":"1 Chronicles 16:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Seek. Am 5:6; Zep 2:2,3 his strength. 2Ch 6:41; Ps 68:35; 78:61 seek his. Ps 4:6; 27:8,9; 67:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-12","title":"1 Chronicles 16:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Remember. 8,9; Ps 103:2; 111:4 the judgments. Ps 19:9; 119:13,20,75,137; Ro 11:33; Re 16:7; 19:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-13","title":"1 Chronicles 16:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>ye seed. Ge 17:7; 28:13,14; 35:10-12 his chosen. Ex 19:5,6; De 7:6; Ps 135:4; 1Pe 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-14","title":"1 Chronicles 16:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>the Lord. Ex 15:2; Ps 63:1; 95:7; 100:3; 118:28 his judgments. 12; Ps 48:10,11; 97:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-15","title":"1 Chronicles 16:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>ye mindful. Ps 25:10; 44:17; 105:8; Mal 4:4 a thousand. De 7:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-16","title":"1 Chronicles 16:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>which he made. Ge 15:18; 17:2; 26:3; 28:13,14; 35:11; Ex 3:15; Ne 9:8; Lu 1:72,73 Ac 3:25; Ga 3:15-17; Heb 6:13-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-17","title":"1 Chronicles 16:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>for a law. Ps 78:10 an everlasting. Ge 17:7,8; Ex 3:17; Jos 24:11-13; 2Sa 23:5; Isa 55:3; Jer 11:2 Heb 13:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-18","title":"1 Chronicles 16:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Unto thee. Ge 12:7; 13:15; 17:8; 28:13,14; 35:11,12 lot. Heb. cord. Mic 2:5 inheritance. Nu 26:53-56; De 32:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-19","title":"1 Chronicles 16:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>but few. Heb. but men of number. a few. Ge 34:30; Ac 7:5; Heb 11:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-20","title":"1 Chronicles 16:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>they went. Ge 12:10; 20:1; 46:3,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-21","title":"1 Chronicles 16:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>He suffered. Ge 31:24,29,42 he reproved. Ge 12:17; 20:3; Ex 7:15-18; 9:13-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-22","title":"1 Chronicles 16:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>Touch. 1Ki 19:16; Ps 105:15; 1Jo 2:27 prophets. Ge 20:7; 27:39,40; 48:19,20; 49:8-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-23","title":"1 Chronicles 16:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>Sing. 9; Ps 96:1-13; Ex 15:21; Ps 30:4; Isa 12:5 shew forth. Ps 40:10; 71:15; Isa 51:6-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-24","title":"1 Chronicles 16:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>2Ki 19:19; Ps 22:27; Isa 12:2-6; Da 4:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-25","title":"1 Chronicles 16:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>great. Ps 89:7; 144:3-6; Isa 40:12-17; Re 15:3,4 he also. Ex 15:11; Ps 66:3-5; 76:7; Jer 5:22; 10:6-10; Re 15:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-26","title":"1 Chronicles 16:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>all the gods. Le 19:4; Ps 115:4-8; Isa 44:9-20; Jer 10:10-14; Ac 19:26; 1Co 8:4 the Lord. Ps 102:25; Isa 40:26; 42:5; 44:24; Jer 10:11,12; Re 14:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-27","title":"1 Chronicles 16:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>Glory. Ps 8:1; 16:11; 63:2,3; Joh 17:24 strength. Ps 27:4-6; 28:7,8; 43:2-4 place. Ps 96:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-28","title":"1 Chronicles 16:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>Give. Ps 29:1,2; 68:34 ye kindreds. Ps 66:1,2; 67:4,7; 86:8-10; 98:4; 100:1,2; Isa 11:10 glory. 29:10-14; Ps 115:1,2; 1Co 15:10; 2Co 12:9,10; Eph 1:6,17-19 Php 4:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-29","title":"1 Chronicles 16:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>the glory. Ps 89:5-8; 108:3-5; 148:13,14; Isa 6:3; Re 4:9-11; 5:12-14; 7:12 bring. 1Ki 8:41-43; Ps 68:30,31; 72:10,15; Isa 60:6,7 come. Ps 95:2; 100:4 the beauty. 2Ch 20:21; Ps 29:2; 50:2; 96:6,9; 110:3; Eze 7:20; 24:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-30","title":"1 Chronicles 16:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>before him. 23,25; Ps 96:9; Re 11:15 stable. Ps 33:9; 93:1; 148:5,6; Isa 49:8; Jer 10:12; Col 1:17; Heb 1:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-31","title":"1 Chronicles 16:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>Let the heavens. Ps 19:1; 89:5; 148:1-4; Lu 2:13,14; 15:10 let the earth. Ps 97:1; 98:4; Lu 2:10 The Lord. Ps 93:1,2; 96:10; 99:1; 145:1; Isa 33:22; Mt 6:13; Re 19:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-32","title":"1 Chronicles 16:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>the sea. Ps 93:4; 98:7 fields. Ps 98:8; 148:9,10; Isa 44:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-33","title":"1 Chronicles 16:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>the trees. Ps 96:12,13; Eze 17:22-24 because. Ps 98:9; 2Th 1:8,10; 2Pe 3:14; Re 11:17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-34","title":"1 Chronicles 16:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>give thanks. 2Ch 5:13; 7:3; Ezr 3:11; Ps 106:1; 107:1; 118:1; 136:1-26; Jer 33:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-35","title":"1 Chronicles 16:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>Save us. Ps 14:7; 53:6; 79:9,10; 106:47,48 that we may give. Ps 105:45; Isa 43:21; Eph 1:12; 1Pe 2:5,9 glory. 9,10; Ps 44:8; Isa 45:25; 1Co 1:31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-36","title":"1 Chronicles 16:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>Blessed. 1Ki 8:15,56; Ps 72:18,19; 106:48; Eph 1:3; 1Pe 1:3 said. De 27:15-26; Ne 8:6; Jer 28:6; 1Co 14:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-37","title":"1 Chronicles 16:37","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":37,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":37},"content":"<p>before the ark. 4-6; 15:17-24; 25:1-6 as every. 2Ch 8:14; Ezr 3:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-38","title":"1 Chronicles 16:38","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":38,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":38},"content":"<p>Obed-edom. 13:14; 26:4-8 Jeduthun. 25:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-39","title":"1 Chronicles 16:39","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":39,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":39},"content":"<p>Zadok. 12:28 before. 21:29; 2Ch 1:3,4,13 in the high. 1Ki 3:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-40","title":"1 Chronicles 16:40","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":40,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":40},"content":"<p>To offer. Ex 29:38-42; Nu 28:3-8; 1Ki 18:29; 2Ch 2:4; 31:3; Ezr 3:3 Eze 46:13-15; Da 9:21; Am 4:4 morning and evening. Heb. in the morning and in the evening.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-41","title":"1 Chronicles 16:41","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":41,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":41},"content":"<p>Heman. 37; 6:39-47; 25:1-6 expressed. 12:31; Nu 1:17; Ezr 8:20 to give. 34; 2Ch 5:13; 7:3; 20:21; Ezr 3:11; Ps 103:17; Jer 33:11; Lu 1:50</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-42","title":"1 Chronicles 16:42","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":42,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":42},"content":"<p>trumpets. 2Ch 29:25-28; Ps 150:3-6 musical instruments. 25:6; Ps 84:10 porters. Heb. for the gate.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ch-16-43","title":"1 Chronicles 16:43","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CH","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":43,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":43},"content":"<p>all the people. 2Sa 6:19,20; 1Ki 8:66 to bless. Ge 18:19; Jos 24:15; Ps 101:2</p>"}]}